(scripts/), and the SREP config plus build tooling (srep/) authored for this
repository.

The key material under keys/ is NOT covered by this license. Those files are
redistributed from Microsoft's secureboot_objects repository and are licensed
under BSD-2-Clause-Patent by Microsoft. See keys/README.md and keys/License.txt.

No third-party executable is distributed here. srep/build/ builds the UEFI Shell
and RegularExpressionDxe from TianoCore EDK2 (BSD-2-Clause-Patent) and SREP
(Smokeless Runtime EFI Patcher) from its author's sources; those builds happen on
your machine and each component keeps its own terms. SREP itself carries no
licence statement at all - see srep/build/THIRD-PARTY.md before redistributing
anything you build with it.
